# Who must approve a pull request, by path. The last matching line wins for
# each file, and every owner matched by the pull request must approve.
#
# This mirrors the review checks in .app_checks.exs: human_review lists what
# an engineer must read, architect_review what an architect must read, and
# separate_pr the files that must be alone in their pull request. Keep the
# two files in step. See docs/patterns/code-review.md.
#
# Replace @org/engineers and @org/architects with your teams. Make architects
# members of engineers too, so one architect approval satisfies both lines.

# human_review: every file needs an engineer
*                                        @org/engineers

# neither list: no owner, so the one approval the branch rule requires can come from
# the automated reviewer
/lib/app_web/live/**/*.heex
/lib/app_web/controllers/**/*.heex
/docs/
/README.md

# architect_review
/lib/app_web.ex                      @org/architects
/lib/app_web/components/             @org/architects
/lib/app_web/router.ex               @org/architects
/lib/app_web/endpoint.ex             @org/architects
/lib/app/application.ex              @org/architects
/config/                                 @org/architects
/mix.exs                                 @org/architects
/mix.lock                                @org/architects
/.tool-versions                          @org/architects
/test/support/                           @org/architects
/.github/                                @org/architects
/Dockerfile                              @org/architects
/.dockerignore                           @org/architects
/docker/                                 @org/architects
/bin/                                    @org/architects
/rel/                                    @org/architects

# separate_pr: also kept alone in their pull request by mix app_checks
/AGENTS.md                               @org/architects
/.github/CODEOWNERS                      @org/architects
/.github/workflows/protected-*           @org/architects
/.credo.exs                              @org/architects
/.check.exs                              @org/architects
/.app_checks.exs                         @org/architects
/priv/checks/                            @org/architects
